    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμετά-στρεπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not to be diverted,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				11.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				705.62
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμετα-στρεπτί</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ι-</span>] or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εί</span>
			<i>without turning round, straight forward,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεύγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					4.50
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				854c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				620e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.517
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				8.5
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τρεπτί</span>
			), etc.</div>
